header: "---\nname: jake-linkedin-li-carousel\ndescription: \"Build a LinkedIn document post (carousel) - slide-by-slide copy, the cover that earns the swipe, and the PDF to upload. Use when the user says \\\"carousel\\\", \\\"document post\\\", \\\"slides for LinkedIn\\\", \\\"turn this into a carousel\\\", or has a list-shaped idea that would die as a text post.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/linkedin-agent-skill\n  upstream_skill: li-carousel\n  upstream_commit: add2c23882fe79180737d242ff80a5da205eda6a\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
